!Name: catacryst
!C"catacryct", a 58-cell quadratic growth pattern
!CNick Gotts, 21 Apr 2000
!C
!CThis was at one time the smallest pattern known pattern
!Cwith a faster-than-linear growth rate. It has since been
!Csurpassed by "metacatacryst".
!C
!CYou need to run this at least 41,000 generations to
!Csee anything interesting happen.
!Source: jslife-oversize-20100113
